# Data Dictionary

## Commodity Value by Year

| Field          | Description                       | Data Type     |
| -------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------- |
| Commodity      | Name of the seafood commodity     | Categorical   |
| Financial Year | Financial year of the observation | Date / String |
| Value          | Industry value for the commodity  | Numerical     |

## Value by Jurisdiction and Sector

| Field          | Description                                  | Data Type     |
| -------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ------------- |
| Jurisdiction   | Australian state, territory, or Commonwealth | Categorical   |
| Category       | Seafood category                             | Categorical   |
| Year           | Year of the observation                      | Numerical     |
| Value          | Industry value                               | Numerical     |
| Financial Year | Financial year                               | Date / String |
| Sector         | Aquaculture or wild catch                    | Categorical   |

## Fisheries Production by Country

| Field                    | Description                                   | Data Type   |
| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- | ----------- |
| Country                  | Country associated with the production record | Categorical |
| Year                     | Year of production                            | Numerical   |
| Production (metric tons) | Seafood production volume                     | Numerical   |

## GVP FRDC Dataset

This dataset contains additional fisheries and aquaculture industry information, including jurisdiction, sector, category, and value fields.

The exact fields used in the dashboard are documented in the Tableau workbook and the project methodology.
